# Notebook outputs never enter a commit: every pipeline run rewrites them, so
# the three notebooks showed up modified after each run and their diffs were
# pages of printed counts and base64 figures. The results belong in
# output/report/report.html and output/cutpoints/cutpoint_report.html.
#
# Enable on a fresh clone — the filter itself lives in .git/config, which git
# does not carry, and --keep-id matters because some cells here have
# deliberate ids ("figure-profile-code") that nbstripout would otherwise
# renumber to "4":
#
#   pip install nbstripout
#   nbstripout --install --keep-id
#
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout
*.ipynb diff=ipynb

# Exception. This notebook's outputs ARE the artifact — it renders the
# manuscript's tables and a figure preview, and stripping them would leave a
# file that shows nothing until someone re-runs it.
meningioma-manuscript.ipynb filter= diff=
